{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach it. Take and check for properties. Move to new location. list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInRange    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObject    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToNewLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
